Note that the parameter value is limited to the maximum torque of the motor connected.",181,
5,26,부방향 토크 한계,"With Pr5.21(토크 한계 선택)=4 set, set the negative direction torque limit when TL_SW is at 1.
Note that the parameter value is limited to the maximum torque of the motor connected.",181,
