 0 : disable the filter
This setting is always valid regardless of the state of the gain switching.",147,
6,43,2 단 토크 필터 감쇠 항,Set the damping term of two-stage torque filter.,48,
7,0,LED 초기 상태,전면 패널의 7세그먼트 LED에 표시 하는 데이터의 종류를 선택합니다.,65,
7,1,Address indicated time at power-up,Set up the station address display time upon turning ON of control power.,73,
