7,10,소프트웨어 제한 기능 선택,"Enable/disable software limit function.
When selecting enable, set the software limit value through Pr7.11 and Pr7.12.",118,
7,11,정방향 소프트웨어 제한값,"Set up software limit on positive direction.
When the limit is exceeded, RTEX communication status P_SOT will be turned ON (=1).
Notes) Pr7.11 must be larger than Pr7.12.
 P_SOT will not be turned ON until return to home completes.",231,
7,12,부방향 소프트웨어 제한값,"Set up software limit on negative direction.
When the limit is exceeded, RTEX communication status N_SOT will be turned ON (=1).
Notes) Pr7.11 must be larger than Pr7.12.
 N_SOT will not be turned ON until return to home completes.",231,
7,13,절대적 원점 위치 오프셋,Set up the offset value on encoder position (external scale position) when using absolute encoder (absolute external scale) and mechanical coordinate system position.,166,
7,14,주전원 오프 경고 검출 시간,"주전원 차단 상태가 연속했을 경우, 주전원 오프 경고를 찾을 때까지 시간을 설정합니다.
설정값 0 ~ 9, 2000의 경우, 주전원 오프 검출은 무효가 됩니다.",144,
7,15,NEAR 검출 범위,"If the difference between target position and command position is below a set value, the NEAR of communication status is set to 1.",130,
