7,20,RTEX 통신 사이클 선택,"Set up the RTEX communication cycle.
Notes) Do not set other than 0, 1, 3 or 6.
 They are used by the manufacturer so that the user is not allowed to set this parameter.",169,
7,21,RTEX command update period,Setup the ratio of RTEX communication cycle and command update cycle.,69,
7,22,RTEX 기능 확장 설정 1,Sets each RTEX functions by bit unit.,37,
7,23,RTEX 기능 확장 설정 2,Sets each RTEX functions by bit unit.,37,
7,24,RTEX 기능 확장 설정 3,Sets each RTEX functions by bit unit.,37,
7,25,RTEX velocity unit,"Sets the unit of speed data used in RTEX communication.
Sets the unit both for both command data such as command speed and for actual data such as response speed.",162,
7,26,RTEX 연속 통신 이상 경고 설정,"Generates RTEX continuous communication error warning when the number of continuous errors reaches the setting of this parameter.
When the setting value is 0, this function is disabled and no warning is issued.",210,
7,27,RTEX 누적 통신 이상 경고 설정,"Generates RTEX accumulated communication error warning when the number of accumulated errors reaches the setting of this parameter.
When the setting value is 0, this function is disabled and no warning is generated.",215,
7,28,RTEX Update Counter 이상 경고 설정,"When the number of continuous updates of Update_Counter has not reached the value set by this parameter, RTEX_Update_Counter error warning is generated.
When the setting value is 0, this function is disabled and no warning is generated.",236,
7,29,RTEX 모니터 선택 1,Select the monitor type of Response_data1.,42,
7,30,RTEX 모니터 선택 2,Select the monitor type of Response_data2 when non-cyclic command = 0h.,71,
7,31,RTEX 모니터 선택 3,Select the monitor type of Response_data3 when non-cyclic command = 0h.,71,
7,32,RTEX 모니터 선택 4,Select the monitor type of Sub_Response_data1 when 32byte mode or sub command = 0h.,83,
